WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.869
Week 30: Por, Para, Passive, and Impersonal Se. explain purpose and cause describe processes report institutional action

2
00:00:08.869 --> 00:00:21.985
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can explain purpose and cause, describe processes, report institutional action. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:21.985 --> 00:00:29.489
Language system. Por versus para; passive voice; passive and impersonal se; agent suppression and focus.

4
00:00:29.489 --> 00:00:36.843
Sound and delivery. Distinguish por/para in connected speech and foreground the information focus.

5
00:00:36.843 --> 00:00:46.013
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:46.013 --> 00:01:14.212
Model language. La medida fue aprobada por el consejo. — The measure was approved by the council. Se publicaron los resultados ayer. — The results were published yesterday. Trabajamos para mejorar el acceso. — We work to improve access. El servicio cerró por falta de fondos. — The service closed because of a lack of funding. Se requiere identificación para entrar. — Identification is required to enter.

7
00:01:14.212 --> 00:01:23.961
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
